ARCHITECTURE
  Seam pattern (Shared-free surface) + Shared-backed live adapter, mirroring the
  established feature-view seams (ActiveSessionsSection) and the Sources/Features
  BatteryRadialGauge Shared-free/Shared-backed split. The model binds a
  SharingTripsSource; production injects SharingTripsLiveSource (KMP TripsStore,
  "consumes the KMP core" ADR-004); previews/tests inject InMemorySharingTripsSource.
  SI values stay canonical; conversion is at the display boundary via the shared
  Units converters (S5) in UnitsSharingTripsFormatting.

  AI section (web AITripPostcardShareCardImageGeneration) is feature-flagged off and
  is a SEPARATE component parity unit — the manifest extracts only the 2 GlassPanels
  for page:sharing/SharingTrips, so it is correctly out of scope here (not narrowing).

