 PATH RECONCILIATION (Honesty Covenant #9 — no silent drift)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  The prompt's Output/Allowed-files name apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Sharing/** and
  the platform string catalog Localizable.xcstrings — both honored verbatim. Because
  TeslaSync/Features is a NEW source root (this is the first P7 page), it was added to
  project.yml (both app targets) and .swiftlint.yml so the page actually compiles +
  lints (otherwise it would be dead code — an ADR-011 violation). The catalog stores
  the ported web i18n under a translation.* prefix (translation.sharing.trips.title …),
  which native components do NOT resolve; bare web keys (sharing.trips.title …) were
  added so String(localized:)/LocalizedStringKey resolve them, matching the registered
  AppSettingsView convention. Live KMP composition (store vending) is app-wide deferred
  (AppContainer.bootstrap is a documented stub; no surface is live-wired yet — e.g.
  BatteryRadialGaugeWidget), so the route is registered with the in-memory source
  (resolving the real empty state) until bootstrap injects SharingTripsLiveSource.

